    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "In this much-travelled world, there are still thousands of places which are inaccessible to tourists.",
      "translation": "在这个旅游业发达的世界里，仍有成千上万个游客无法到达的地方。",
      "startTime": 14.61,
      "endTime": 23.06,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "inaccessible",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "达不到的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We always assume that villagers in remote places are friendly and hospitable.",
      "translation": "我们总是认为偏远地区的人们是友好且好客的。",
      "startTime": 23.07,
      "endTime": 29.73,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "remote",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "偏远的"
          },
          {
            "word": "hospitable",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "好客的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "But people who are cut off not only from foreign tourists, but even from their own countrymen can be hostile to travellers.",
      "translation": "但那些不仅与外国游客隔绝，甚至与本国同胞也隔绝的人们，可能对旅行者怀有敌意。",
      "startTime": 29.74,
      "endTime": 40.01,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "hostile",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "敌对的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Visits to really remote villages are seldom enjoyable--as my wife and I discovered during a tour through the Balkans.",
      "translation": "去真正偏远的村庄旅行很少是愉快的——正如我妻子和我，在一次穿越巴尔干半岛的旅行中发现的那样。",
      "startTime": 40.02,
      "endTime": 48.8,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "seldom",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "很少"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We had spent several days in a small town and visited a number of old churches in the vicinity.",
      "translation": "我们在一个小镇住了几天，参观了附近的许多古老教堂。",
      "startTime": 48.81,
      "endTime": 56.12,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "vicinity",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "邻近地区"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "These attracted many visitors, for they were not only of great architectural interest, but contained a large number of beautifully preserved frescoes as well.",
      "translation": "这些教堂吸引了许多游客，因为它们不仅具有极大的建筑研究价值，而且还包含大量保存完好的壁画。",
      "startTime": 56.13,
      "endTime": 67.94,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "architectural",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "建筑学的"
          },
          {
            "word": "frescoes",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "壁画"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "On the day before our departure, several bus loads of tourists descended on the town.",
      "translation": "在我们出发的前一天，好几辆公车的游客突然降临到这个小镇。",
      "startTime": 67.95,
      "endTime": 74.49,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "departure",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "离开"
          },
          {
            "word": "descend",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "下沉，突然降临"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "This was more than we could bear, so we decided to spend our last day exploring the countryside.",
      "translation": "这超出了我们的承受能力，所以我们决定利用最后一天去勘探农村地区。",
      "startTime": 74.5,
