    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Taking a path which led out of the town, we crossed a few fields until we came to a dense wood.",
      "translation": "沿着一条通往镇外的小路，我们穿过几块田地，直到来到一片茂密的树林。",
      "startTime": 82.86,
      "endTime": 90.37,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "dense",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "密集的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We expected the path to end abruptly, but we found that it traced its way through the trees.",
      "translation": "我们原以为小路会突然中断，但我们发现它在树丛中穿行。",
      "startTime": 90.38,
      "endTime": 98.21,
      "analysis": {
