            "meaning": "突然地"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "We tramped through the wood for over two hours until we arrived at a deep stream.",
      "translation": "我们在林中跋涉了两个多小时，直到来到一条深溪边。",
      "startTime": 98.22,
      "endTime": 104.53,
      "analysis": {
