            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "停留，歇息"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The place consisted of a straggling unmade road which was lined on either side by small houses.",
      "translation": "那个地方由一条坎坷不平、没有修筑过的路组成，路的兩旁排列着一间间小房子。",
      "startTime": 139.39,
      "endTime": 146.92,
      "analysis": {
