            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "未铺成的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Even under a clear blue sky, the village looked forbidding, as all the houses were built of grey mud bricks.",
      "translation": "即使在晴朗的蓝天下，村庄看起来也令人心惊胆战，因为所有的房子都是用灰色的泥砖盖成的。",
      "startTime": 146.93,
      "endTime": 156.08,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "forbidding",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "令人畏惧的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The village seemed deserted,",
      "translation": "村子似乎已经荒废了，",
